(Q: Identify and briefly describe the four core analytical modules integrated into) Tj
T* (FINANCELY, specifying at least one key AI/ML technique or indicator used by each.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0. 0.392 0. rg
56.6929133858267775 269.2915748031495013 Td
(A: FINANCELY integrates four core analytical modules: 1\) **Sentiment Analysis**, which) Tj
T* (uses BERT-based models for financial news analysis. 2\) **Time Series Forecasting**,) Tj
T* (employing Facebook Prophet with uncertainty quantification. 3\) **Technical Analysis**,) Tj
T* (utilizing several indicators such as Bollinger Bands, MACD, and RSI. 4\) **Fundamental) Tj
T* (Analysis**, which computes automated Piotroski Scores \(ranging from 0-9\) based on nine) Tj
T* (financial criteria.) Tj
ET
